	(text "03 Bias DAC (I2C, power-on reset to zero) and four cold-by-default bias channels: Vg1 = VNC + Ic x 30k, Ic = Vdac / 1k. DAC 0 V = -71 V (cold), 2.5 V = -0.3 V (typical board). docs/bias_supply.md, sim/bias_supply."
