	(text "DAC: ADDR0 = GND -> 0x48. ~CLR low while the watchdog clamps (CLAMP_WD high): the DAC returns to zero whenever BIAS_EN stops, so a restarted firmware must rewrite it. ~LDAC = GND. Outputs E-H unused. VREF2V5 also feeds the ADC (sheet 04)."
