	(text "Per channel: DAC -> 10k / 330n (48 Hz), 1M pull-down (DAC high-Z = cold), two clamps (watchdog, VNC monitors: MON_FAULT); op amp + NPN: Ic = Vdac / 1k; PNP mirror at +15 V (300 V parts) sources Ic into OUT; 30k || 100n to VNC; 300 V NPN follower, 2x 22k (midpoint filtered) to -80 V, 1k / 1u to BIASn."
